  *
+ * And one decides what a heal skill restores:
+ *
+ *   skill("AB_CHEAL", {
+ *     heal = function(c, stock) return c.base * 85 // 100 end,
+ *   })
+ *
+ * heal runs for AL_HEAL, AB_HIGHNESSHEAL and AB_CHEAL when they heal (not
